            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"My ER diagram shows three entities: Student, Course, and Enrollment. Student has attributes StudentID (PK), Name, Email. Course has CourseID (PK), Title, Code. Enrollment is a relationship with EnrollDate.\"\n}"
